---
title: Compose lifecycle retirement
---
stateDiagram-v2
  direction TB
  [*] --> attached
  attached --> captured : Compose exits
  captured --> signalled : owned mux stop
  signalled --> commandsAbsent : command groups absent
  signalled --> escalated : grace expires
  escalated --> commandsAbsent : absence confirmed
  escalated --> retained : deadline or probe error
  commandsAbsent --> wrappersAbsent : wrapper groups absent
  commandsAbsent --> wrapperEscalated : grace expires
  wrapperEscalated --> wrappersAbsent : absence confirmed
  wrapperEscalated --> retained : deadline or probe error
  wrappersAbsent --> retired : remove owned record
  retired --> [*]
  note right of retained
    INV unknown is retained
    Report unconfirmed retirement
    Keep dependent helpers
  end note
  note right of signalled
    Mux acknowledgement is not group exit
    FIFO EOF is not group absence
  end note
  classDef live stroke-width:1.6px
  class attached live
  class signalled,escalated,commandsAbsent,wrapperEscalated wait
  class wrappersAbsent,retired ok
  class retained fail
